# Playwright Accessibility Rules

- Add accessibility checks for critical pages and user flows, not only isolated components.
- Use `@axe-core/playwright` (or equivalent) to run automated WCAG checks in E2E contexts.
- Include keyboard navigation assertions for focus order and visible focus states.
- Assert semantic structure and labels for forms, buttons, and dialog interactions.
- Prioritize fixing serious/critical violations and prevent regressions with CI execution.
- Keep accessibility tests deterministic and independent from unrelated UI styling changes.

## Example
```ts
await injectAxe(page);
await checkA11y(page);
```
